{%- comment -%}
  Prompt template — caller_note (TEST FIXTURE). Receives the caller from the engine and
  names it, and repeats the `note` key of its prompt entry, so the conformance suite can
  confirm prompts/get passes `principal`, `agent` and `prompt` to the template.
{%- endcomment -%}
{% liquid
